description:
In repos/activity-api/src/lib/posterior-update.ts, log why a variant posterior update was skipped, so a frozen posterior becomes diagnosable instead of silent.

Measured on the live substrate: the feature_compose arm has held at alpha 53.65 and beta 19.22 for over five hours while its execution rows accumulated twenty nine not-reached verdicts. Four candidate explanations were checked and refuted: the tier classifier guards an empty task list and returns all_stochastic rather than all_deterministic, the information yield on those rows is null rather than idle, the variant identifier and activity identifier match exactly, and the reach classifier returns not-reached for a trace with no tags and success false. The decision to skip is therefore being taken somewhere that emits no record, which is the same defect class as an execution that writes no row.

Perform exactly one replacement. Find the sole occurrence of this line:
  const skipVariantUpdate = tierClass === 'all_deterministic' || trace.metadata?.information_yield === 'idle';

Replace it with these lines:
  const skipVariantUpdate = tierClass === 'all_deterministic' || trace.metadata?.information_yield === 'idle';
  if (skipVariantUpdate || ungraded || (alphaDelta === 0 && betaDelta === 0)) {
    logger.info('posterior variant update SKIPPED', {
      activity_id: activityId,
      reason: skipVariantUpdate ? (tierClass === 'all_deterministic' ? 'all_deterministic' : 'information_yield_idle') : (ungraded ? 'reach_ungraded' : 'zero_deltas'),
      reach_verdict: reachVerdict,
      tier_class: tierClass,
      alpha_delta: alphaDelta,
      beta_delta: betaDelta,
      has_tags: Array.isArray(trace.tags) && trace.tags.length > 0,
      task_count: Array.isArray(trace.tasks) ? trace.tasks.length : 0,
    });
  }

This adds logging only. The existing constant is preserved verbatim on the first line and every downstream use of it is unchanged, so no control flow is altered. The identifiers referenced are all already in scope at this point in the function: activityId, tierClass, ungraded, reachVerdict, alphaDelta, betaDelta and trace. The logger is already imported and used throughout this file.

One replacement, one file. Change nothing else.

